                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "townships"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a24b1b1a-d267-33c9-869d-531608bbd494",
                        "entry_id": "19bdffb7-e96f-3353-84cd-172ca93b343a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cité (ensemble de quartiers) réservée aux Noirs au temps de l’apartheid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f012105b-cd44-4cbd-b95b-9219ee0d413e",
                                "sense_id": "a24b1b1a-d267-33c9-869d-531608bbd494",
                                "text": "Dans son étude sur les townships du Cap, Houssay-Holzschuch (1999) note que plusieurs décennies d’enfermement spatial ont participé à y installer avec rigidité des pratiques culturelles."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b68439fd-8d30-34de-b560-0948d754b739",
                        "entry_id": "19bdffb7-e96f-3353-84cd-172ca93b343a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Canton, unité cadastrale de base du maillage mis en place en 1785 à l’ouest des Appalaches au Canada."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a6db306-9902-4123-a330-5eab428f626c",
                                "sense_id": "b68439fd-8d30-34de-b560-0948d754b739",
                                "text": "1ᵉʳ juillet 1845 : Création de la municipalité de canton de Grenville, «comprenant le township et l’augmentation de Grenville, avec le township de Harrington»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "340c5f25-867d-40cc-a401-a8c1973c24f5",
                        "source_entry_id": "19bdffb7-e96f-3353-84cd-172ca93b343a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a24b1b1a-d267-33c9-869d-531608bbd494",
                        "target_lang_word": "township",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "township",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea60b8a2-b59d-3bec-8b4d-d63f2a0d6ffa",
                                        "entry_id": "970ae81d-1c2a-3463-9827-18bbd4a2b969",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The territory of a town."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d8c4512-02d0-4959-8fb9-ee236e60f0ec",
                                                "sense_id": "ea60b8a2-b59d-3bec-8b4d-d63f2a0d6ffa",
                                                "text": "The train is usually crowded and half the township of Forres seems to turn out to watch it go off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6aa564e-e40e-43bf-a1fc-c31939e8dbf9",
                                                "sense_id": "ea60b8a2-b59d-3bec-8b4d-d63f2a0d6ffa",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, everyone knows that the crops grown at Chou-Shui River are of high quality, like the rice of Siluo Township, watermelons of Erlun Township, garlic of Cihtong Township, flowers of Shijo Township, guava of Shetou Township, and so on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "302bcfed-1b79-4fec-9eed-87b9f5322958",
                                                "sense_id": "ea60b8a2-b59d-3bec-8b4d-d63f2a0d6ffa",
                                                "text": "Tondop said the township of Mendi is slowly getting back to normal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58cd0507-96af-3493-a392-8f4fcaa7c885",
                                        "entry_id": "970ae81d-1c2a-3463-9827-18bbd4a2b969",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subdivision of a county."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac62301b-b236-39ac-9da9-38693737d94c",
                                        "entry_id": "970ae81d-1c2a-3463-9827-18bbd4a2b969",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area set aside for nonwhite occupation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Africa"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b197fecb-578b-4d24-aabb-540e38bcbdde",
                                                "sense_id": "ac62301b-b236-39ac-9da9-38693737d94c",
                                                "text": "In addition, the council has completed the planning of a new Coloured township on the site of the existing African township."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f50acfed-af3b-3200-b149-db01f250afef",
                                        "entry_id": "970ae81d-1c2a-3463-9827-18bbd4a2b969",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A nonwhite (usually subeconomic) area attached to a city."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Africa"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce1e432a-bb70-4e69-9618-461d4be3db3f",
                                                "sense_id": "f50acfed-af3b-3200-b149-db01f250afef",
                                                "text": "Growing up in the township of Zwide, just outside Port Elizabeth, bed for Kolisi was a pile of cushions on the living-room floor and finding enough to eat was a daily struggle. […] So, the man from the townships can certainly empathize with the pain lockdown is inflicting on the less fortunate in his country."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51bf071d-a215-3f52-8f23-ab140255e3ef",
                                        "entry_id": "970ae81d-1c2a-3463-9827-18bbd4a2b969",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small town."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "New-Zealand"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
